## PACKAGE STRUCTURE

Organize by feature, not layer. Each feature package owns its full vertical slice.

```
com.example.myservice/
  Application.java

  user/
    User.java                    # domain entity
    UserService.java             # interface
    DefaultUserService.java      # implementation (package-private)
    UserController.java          # REST layer (package-private)
    UserRepository.java          # data layer
    CreateUserRequest.java       # request DTO
    UserResponse.java            # response DTO
    UserNotFoundException.java   # exception

  common/
    StringUtils.java             # shared utilities
    ValidationUtils.java

  config/
    ClockConfig.java
    SecurityConfig.java
```

Not this:
```
controllers/
  UserController.java
services/
  UserService.java
  UserServiceImpl.java
repositories/
  UserRepository.java
models/
  User.java
```

